      <link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18khC6HEQt</link>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ed8a7cec42edbebee2d8fccc36dd6fca0f9e8b50.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%" /&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;视频简介:&lt;/b&gt; 给74岁的父亲准备生日礼物，到底能有多硬核？

